              "id": "target-offering",
              "name": "target_offering",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Omegtric Technologies. Omegtric Technologies Limited is a Nigerian technology and engineering company offering software development, IT consultancy, computer and network engineering, ICT equipment distribution, systems installation and maintenance, and technology training. Its products include ExamsPrep, an exam preparation platform; SkillsBridge, a learning management and career-readiness platform; and MyResult, a digital academic result management system. The company may be interested in organizations such as educational institutions, schools, universities, training centers, businesses requiring custom software or IT infrastructure, organizations seeking technology equipment, and companies needing IT support or engineering services. When qualifying leads, assess whether the company's activities indicate a plausible need for Omegtric's specific products or services. Use publicly available evidence, explain the reason for each recommendation, and flag uncertain cases for human review."
            }
          ]
        },
