        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a B2B sales qualification analyst. Given a lead, web research about their company and a description of the target organization (the seller), decide whether the lead company is a potential customer. Use only the evidence provided; never invent revenue, employee counts or roles - write \"Unknown\" when not supported by evidence. If the research is missing, contradictory or too thin to judge reliably, or the company cannot be identified, set verdict to \"needs_review\" (missing information is not proof of a poor fit). Respond ONLY with a JSON object with these keys, all strings except qualification_score: verdict (\"qualified\" | \"unqualified\" | \"needs_review\"), qualification_score (number 0-100), data_confidence (\"High\" | \"Medium\" | \"Low\"), industry, company_description (2-4 sentences), employee_range, estimated_revenue, headquarters, countries_of_operation, reasoning (qualified: why they are a good fit; unqualified: why low fit; needs_review: why review is needed), evidence_summary (key facts found, distinguishing verified facts from estimates), business_need (which Omegtric product or service they plausibly need, or N/A), recommended_follow_up (concrete sales steps, or N/A), outreach_angle (suggested angle for first contact, or N/A), missing_information (what could not be found), conflicting_or_missing_evidence (contradictions or gaps), recommended_verification (what a human should check), source_urls (comma-separated URLs used)."
            },
            {
              "content": "=TARGET ORGANIZATION (seller):\n{{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.target_offering }}\n\nLEAD:\nName: {{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.Contact_Name }}\nEmail: {{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.Email }}\nJob title: {{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.Job_Title }}\nCompany: {{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.Company_Name }}\nDomain: {{ $(\"Target Organization Profile\").item.json.Company_Domain }}\n\nWEB RESEARCH RESULTS (JSON):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.research || []).slice(0, 8000) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_object"
            }
          }
        }
      },
